    </questionnote>
    <questiondescription format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>This question is based on the definition b^x = a ⇔ log_b a = x in the section Review of Logarithms of the CBC Grade 11 Mathematics textbook (INNODEMS). Rebuilt: it had no PRT at all, so nothing was marked. Students now fill in the base, the exponent and the result.</p>
<p id="concept">Logarithmic form to index form</p>]]></text>
